  "domain_contract": {
    "N": "{1,2,3,...}; positive integers, not including 0.",
    "Z": "{...,-2,-1,0,1,2,...}; integers.",
    "Q": "{m/n : m in Z, n in N}; rational numbers with positive integer denominator.",
    "F": "Q\\Z; the lesson's fraction set consists of rational numbers that are not integers, regardless of their written representation.",
    "inclusions": "N is a proper subset of Z, and Z is a proper subset of Q.",
    "complement": "For A contained in U, the complement of A in U is U\\A = {x in U : x not in A}.",
    "even_integers": "{2t : t in Z}; includes 0 and negative even integers.",
    "odd_integers": "{2t+1 : t in Z}.",
    "divisible_by_3": "{3t : t in Z}; includes 0 and negative multiples of 3.",
    "positive": "x > 0",
    "negative": "x < 0",
    "nonnegative": "x >= 0",
    "nonpositive": "x <= 0",
    "negative_mixed_number": "-u v/w means -(u+v/w), not -u+v/w.",
    "irreducible_m_over_n": "m in Z, n in N, gcd(|m|,n)=1. Integer values have denominator 1; zero may be represented by 0/1.",
    "standard_operations": "Union, intersection, integer divisibility, algebraic substitution, and universal closure claims retain their ordinary mathematical meanings.",
    "no_extra_demands": "No additional ambient restriction, uniqueness requirement for example answers, proof format, or representation constraint is imposed beyond each original prompt."
  },
  "source_definition_evidence": [
    {
      "refs": ["p0195#5"],
      "text": "计数时使用的数，组成自然数集合 $N$."
    },
    {
      "refs": ["p0195#6"],
      "text": "自然数集合包含于比它更大的整数集 $Z$：$N\\subset Z$. 集合 $N$ 和 $Z$ 之间的包含关系如图 $40$ 所示. 大圆中没有画细斜线的部分对应于非正整数集合，即由负整数和零组成的集合. 通常说，非正整数集是整数集内自然数集的余集（或补集）."
    },
    {
      "refs": ["p0195#9"],
      "text": "一般地说，如果有两个集合 $A$ 和 $U$，而且 $A\\subset U$，那么由属于 $U$ 但不属于 $A$ 的元素组成的集合，叫做集合 $U$ 内集合$A$ 的余集（或补集）."
    },
    {
      "refs": ["p0195#10"],
      "text": "而整数集又是另一个更大的集合即有理数集 $Q$ 的子集：$Z\\subset Q$. 有理数集内整数集的余集是分数集. 图 $41$ 上表示的是集合 $N$，$Z$ 和 $Q$ 之间的关系：$N\\subset Z\\subset Q$."
    },
    {
      "refs": ["p0195#11", "p0196#1"],
      "text": "凡是可以写成分子是整数，分母是自然数的分数形式（即 $\\frac{m}{n}$，其中 $m\\in Z$，$n\\in N$）的数，叫做有理数*. 同一个数可以用许多方法表示成这种分数. 例如，$\\frac{1}{2}=\\frac{2}{4}=\\frac{5}{10}=\\frac{40}{80}$；$-\\frac{3}{4}=\\frac{-3}{4}=\\frac{-6}{8}=\\frac{-12}{24}=\\frac{-30}{40}$；$-1.8=\\frac{-9}{5}=\\frac{-18}{10}=\\frac{-180}{100}$；$7=\\frac{7}{1}=\\frac{14}{2}=\\frac{21}{3}=\\frac{105}{15}$；$0=\\frac{0}{1}=\\frac{0}{8}=\\frac{0}{20}$."
    },
    {
      "refs": ["p0196#2"],
      "text": "我们发现，在表示已知有理数的许多分数中间，总有一个并且只有一个分数是不可约分数. 对于整数来说，这个分数的分母等于 $1$."
    }
  ],
